# Changelog
context exclusive whole linestart %changelog EOF
    keyword Revision*\n MARKUP_HEADING
    keyword \*\s\{MWTFS\}*\n MARKUP_HEADING
    keyword \s\s[*] MARKUP_LIST
    keyword $Log*$\n KEYWORD_OTHER

